abstract: >-
  A conservative evidence compiler that audits supported scientific-analysis workflows without
  executing project-authored code and separates demonstrated Findings from questions,
  conditional concerns, disclosures, and unsupported coverage.
keywords:
  - scientific auditing
  - reproducibility
  - static analysis
  - evidence compilation
